<p>Do not store tens of thousands of item IDs or per-item errors as
repeating FileNet properties. Store compact request/batch checkpoints on
BulkRequest and generate a CSV error report at completion. If stronger
recovery is required, optional BulkRequestBatch child custom objects can
represent batches of 100–500 items. Update FileNet progress every few
seconds or after several batches—not after every item.</p>
