<h2 id="cancellation">12.2 Cancellation</h2>
<p>Cancellation is cooperative. The API sets
CancelRequested/CANCEL_REQUESTED. Workers check between safe item or
chunk boundaries, stop discovering new items, finish/rollback only the
current atomic unit, release the lease and mark CANCELLED. Completed
items remain completed; the UI must not imply full rollback.</p>
<h2 id="retry">12.3 Retry</h2>
<p>Automatic retry is limited to transient failures. User/admin retry
creates a new child request containing only eligible failed/skipped item
keys and RetryOfRequestId. Completed items are not repeated. This
preserves an immutable audit trail and avoids mutating a terminal
request back to RUNNING.</p>
