<h1 id="deployment-topology">15. Deployment topology</h1>
<ul>
<li><p>Deploy API/worker instances independently from ICN where
possible; ICN plug-in is a thin adapter.</p></li>
<li><p>Use one or more worker nodes; coordinate claims through FileNet
Status, RequestVersion and LeaseUntil.</p></li>
<li><p>Use separate bounded managed executors per object store and
optionally per action type.</p></li>
<li><p>Store secrets in the platform secret manager; use TLS and
service-to-service authentication.</p></li>
<li><p>Perform rolling deployments: stop new claims, let batches reach
checkpoints, then restart.</p></li>
<li><p>The recovery scheduler may run on every node only if each
candidate first passes the atomic FileNet claim; alternatively elect one
scheduler.</p></li>
</ul>
