<h2 id="acceptance-criteria">16.1 Acceptance criteria</h2>
<ul>
<li><p>Submission returns within the agreed interactive SLA (target ≤
2–3 seconds excluding optional preview).</p></li>
<li><p>Closing the browser or expiring ICN session does not stop
processing.</p></li>
<li><p>A killed worker resumes without duplicating completed side
effects.</p></li>
<li><p>Normal users cannot view or control another user’s request
through UI or direct API calls.</p></li>
<li><p>Bulk load stays within agreed CE latency/resource
guardrails.</p></li>
<li><p>Every terminal request has reconciled counts and an auditable
outcome.</p></li>
<li><p>Partial failures can be exported and retried without repeating
successes.</p></li>
</ul>
